    values:originalText "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868    Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
