doc:sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(2) Misleading representations with respect to future matters" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of applying subsection (1) in relation to a proceeding concerning a representation made with respect to a future matter by:  (a) a party to the proceeding; or  (b) any other person; the party or other person is taken not to have had reasonable grounds for making the representation, unless evidence is adduced to the contrary." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(3) Misleading representations with respect to future matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the person who made the representation is taken to have had reasonable grounds for making the representation; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the person who made the representation had reasonable grounds for making the representation." ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the person who made the representation is taken to have had reasonable grounds for making the representation; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the person who made the representation had reasonable grounds for making the representation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5bb769f1ab27b7905a3f321f3c2ff80ae24132183b95b3181e2b211b33c5aba6" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-4-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibits placing an onus of proof on a person regarding the grounds for making a representation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.38" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-3-norm .
