doc:sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(3) Misleading representations with respect to future matters" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the person who made the representation is taken to have had reasonable grounds for making the representation; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the person who made the representation had reasonable grounds for making the representation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(4) Misleading representations with respect to future matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-4-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Subsection (1) does not limit by implication the meaning of a reference in this Schedule to:  (a) a misleading representation; or  (b) a representation that is misleading in a material particular; or  (c) conduct that is misleading or is likely or liable to mislead; and, in particular, does not imply that a representation that a person makes with respect to any future matter is not misleading merely because the person has reasonable grounds for making the representation. 5  When donations are treated as supplies or acquisitions" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Subsection (1) does not limit by implication the meaning of a reference in this Schedule to:  (a) a misleading representation; or  (b) a representation that is misleading in a material particular; or  (c) conduct that is misleading or is likely or liable to mislead; and, in particular, does not imply that a representation that a person makes with respect to any future matter is not misleading merely because the person has reasonable grounds for making the representation. 5  When donations are treated as supplies or acquisitions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4fe7523e4602d7ff6e2d832715b83ada9377116af3232a2ba5c022e7a251aea0" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-4-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Does not limit the meaning of a reference to misleading representations, conduct, or material particulars." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
