concept:act-sch-2-sec-48-2-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48(6) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-48-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A reference in this section to the supply or possible supply of goods or services is a reference to the supply or possible supply of goods or services to a person whose acquisition or possible acquisition of the goods or services is or would be for the purpose of trade or commerce." ;
