concept:act-sch-2-sec-28-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Contracts to which this Part does not apply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-28-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Part does not apply to:  (a) a contract of marine salvage or towage; or  (b) a charterparty of a ship; or  (c) a contract for the carriage of goods by ship.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1)(c), the reference in that subsection to a contract for the carriage of goods by ship includes a reference to any contract covered by a sea carriage document within the meaning of the amended Hague Rules referred to in section 7(1) of the Carriage of Goods by Sea Act 1991. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (3) This Part does not apply to a contract that is the constitution (within the meaning of section 9 of the Corporations Act 2001) of a company, managed investment scheme or other kind of body. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Part does not apply to:  (a) a contract of marine salvage or towage; or  (b) a charterparty of a ship; or  (c) a contract for the carriage of goods by ship.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1)(c), the reference in that subsection to a contract for the carriage of goods by ship includes a reference to any contract covered by a sea carriage document within the meaning of the amended Hague Rules referred to in section 7(1) of the Carriage of Goods by Sea Act 1991. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (3) This Part does not apply to a contract that is the constitution (within the meaning of section 9 of the Corporations Act 2001) of a company, managed investment scheme or other kind of body. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4ffd080d1c8266adc8c5a7361cdbfb32155060c6040e45f69023dec372bbd798" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-28-3-ss-1 ;
