doc:sch-2-sec-28-3-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "28(2) Contracts to which this Part does not apply" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1)(c), the reference in that subsection to a contract for the carriage of goods by ship includes a reference to any contract covered by a sea carriage document within the meaning of the amended Hague Rules referred to in section 7(1) of the Carriage of Goods by Sea Act 1991. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer .

