    values:originalText "(3) This Part does not apply to a contract that is the constitution (within the meaning of section 9 of the Corporations Act 2001) of a company, managed investment scheme or other kind of body. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
