concept:act-sch-2-sec-41-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41(4) Liability etc. of recipient for unsolicited goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-41-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The recovery period is whichever of the following periods ends first:  (a) the period of 3 months starting on the day after the day on which the person received the goods;  (b) if the person who receives the unsolicited goods gives notice with respect to the goods to the supplier or sender in ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The recovery period is whichever of the following periods ends first:  (a) the period of 3 months starting on the day after the day on which the person received the goods;  (b) if the person who receives the unsolicited goods gives notice with respect to the goods to the supplier or sender in ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "79ddf13c99bb157efc509d7b5231772c5a62d9c38dd660e9ae9c53bbe16778fb" ;
