concept:act-sch-2-sec-44-3-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44(3) Participation in pyramid schemes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-44-3-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To participate in a pyramid scheme is:  (a) to establish or promote the scheme (whether alone or together with another person); or  (b) to take part in the scheme in any capacity (whether or not as an employee or agent of a person who establishes or promotes the scheme, or who otherwise takes part in the scheme)." ;
    skos:definition "(3) To participate in a pyramid scheme is:  (a) to establish or promote the scheme (whether alone or together with another person); or  (b) to take part in the scheme in any capacity (whether or not as an employee or agent of a person who establishes or promotes the scheme, or who otherwise takes part in the scheme)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a5d4ee7dc9a5a7c7a7cdf8bb0bc34a99d20969f4eb4be67ae11401a3b9ef088f" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-44-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Participating in a pyramid scheme is prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
