concept:act-sch-2-sec-48-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48 Single price to be specified in certain circumstances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-48-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person must not, in trade or commerce, in connection with:  (a) the supply, or possible supply, to another person of goods or services of a kind ordinarily acquired for personal, domestic or household use or consumption; or  (b) the promotion by any means of the supply to another person, or of the use by another person, of goods or services of a kind ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person must not, in trade or commerce, in connection with:  (a) the supply, or possible supply, to another person of goods or services of a kind ordinarily acquired for personal, domestic or household use or consumption; or  (b) the promotion by any means of the supply to another person, or of the use by another person, of goods or services of a kind ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5d8ffd1c6251cca2c69545538e9ba12db3f178ecdb922d366b781f3fb25c384f" ;
