concept:act-sch-2-sec-65-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65 Application of this Division to supplies of gas, electricity and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-65-2 ;
    values:originalText "telecommunications  (1) This Division does not apply to a supply if the supply:  (a) is a supply of a kind specified in the regulations; and  (b) is a supply of gas, electricity or a telecommunications service.  (2) A telecommunications service is a service for carrying communications by means of guided or unguided electromagnetic energy or both. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    skos:definition "telecommunications  (1) This Division does not apply to a supply if the supply:  (a) is a supply of a kind specified in the regulations; and  (b) is a supply of gas, electricity or a telecommunications service.  (2) A telecommunications service is a service for carrying communications by means of guided or unguided electromagnetic energy or both. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "717a1cda828d2c9a2678dedb09948a5d5dcf7e2d12bba75947cbde0bdf7c0271" ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-65-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-65-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
