doc:sch-2-sec-65-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "65 Application of this Division to supplies of gas, electricity and" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "telecommunications  (1) This Division does not apply to a supply if the supply:  (a) is a supply of a kind specified in the regulations; and  (b) is a supply of gas, electricity or a telecommunications service.  (2) A telecommunications service is a service for carrying communications by means of guided or unguided electromagnetic energy or both. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer .

