    skos:prefLabel "98 Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-98-2 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A notice under subsection (1) sent by post to a supplier is taken to have been given to the supplier at the time of posting.  (6) There are no requirements relating to the form or content of a notice under subsection (1)." ;
