concept:act-sch-2-sec-108-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "108 Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-108-2 ;
    values:originalText "(b) a cash register receipt; (c) a credit card or debit card statement; (d) a handwritten receipt; (e) a lay-by agreement; (f) a confirmation or receipt number provided for a telephone or internet transaction.  (5) The supplier must ensure that the proof of transaction given under subsection (1) or (3) is transparent." ;
