doc:sch-2-sec-106-3-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "106(2) Supplying etc. consumer goods that do not comply with safety" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person must not, in trade or commerce, offer for supply (other than for export) consumer goods the supply of which is prohibited by subsection (1). Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
