concept:act-sch-2-sec-110-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "110 Places in which interim bans apply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-110-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An interim ban imposed by the Commonwealth Minister applies in all States and Territories.  (2) An interim ban imposed by a responsible Minister who is Minister of a State applies in the State.  (3) An interim ban imposed by a responsible Minister who is a Minister of a Territory applies in the Territory." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An interim ban imposed by the Commonwealth Minister applies in all States and Territories.  (2) An interim ban imposed by a responsible Minister who is Minister of a State applies in the State.  (3) An interim ban imposed by a responsible Minister who is a Minister of a Territory applies in the Territory."@en ;
