doc:sch-2-sec-120-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "120(3) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person must not, in or for the purposes of trade or commerce, manufacture, possess or have control of consumer goods the supply of which is prohibited by subsection (1). Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection." ;
