concept:act-sch-2-sec-123-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "123 Contents of a recall notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-123-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A recall notice for the consumer goods may require one or more suppliers of the goods, or (if no such supplier is known to the responsible Minister who issued the notice) the regulator, to take one or more of the following actions: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A recall notice for the consumer goods may require one or more suppliers of the goods, or (if no such supplier is known to the responsible Minister who issued the notice) the regulator, to take one or more of the following actions: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "32e6df4f4d11250596042785182617b13e8a4be79726eb59c6ec5af1d5037b80" ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Supplier actions required in a recall notice" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
