concept:act-sch-2-sec-125-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "125 Notification by persons who supply consumer goods outside"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-125-2 ;
    values:originalText "Australia if there is compulsory recall  (1)  If consumer goods of a particular kind are recalled as required by a recall notice, a person who has supplied or supplies those consumer goods to a person outside Australia must give the person outside Australia a written notice that complies with subsection (2). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "Australia if there is compulsory recall  (1)  If consumer goods of a particular kind are recalled as required by a recall notice, a person who has supplied or supplies those consumer goods to a person outside Australia must give the person outside Australia a written notice that complies with subsection (2). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5719e063e49862f8de84d1cb433f341334612bc1faebbbd4888f10ab32e0b4b4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "131"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person who supplies consumer goods outside Australia must give a written notice to the recipient upon recall." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.131" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-125-2-norm .
