concept:act-sch-2-sec-129-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "129(2) Safety warning notices about consumer goods and product"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-129-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The responsible Minister may announce in a notice published under subsection (1) of this section:  (a) whether any action under this Part is proposed to be taken in relation to the consumer goods or product related services; and  (b) if it is proposed to take any such action—what action is proposed to be taken. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The responsible Minister may announce in a notice published under subsection (1) of this section:  (a) whether any action under this Part is proposed to be taken in relation to the consumer goods or product related services; and  (b) if it is proposed to take any such action—what action is proposed to be taken. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
