concept:act-sch-2-sec-131-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "131(4) Suppliers to report consumer goods associated with the death or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-131-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting subsection (1), the ways in which the supplier may become aware as mentioned in subsection (1)(b) include receiving the relevant information from any of the following:  (a) a consumer;  (b) a person who re-supplies the consumer goods;  (c) a repairer or insurer of the goods;  (d) an industry organisation or consumer organisation." ;
