doc:sch-2-sec-131-2-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "131(4) Suppliers to report consumer goods associated with the death or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting subsection (1), the ways in which the supplier may become aware as mentioned in subsection (1)(b) include receiving the relevant information from any of the following:  (a) a consumer;  (b) a person who re-supplies the consumer goods;  (c) a repairer or insurer of the goods;  (d) an industry organisation or consumer organisation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-131-2-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "131(5) Suppliers to report consumer goods associated with the death or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-131-2-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The notice must:  (a) identify the consumer goods; and  (b) include information about the following matters to the extent that it is known by the supplier at the time the notice is given:  (i) when, and in what quantities, the consumer goods were manufactured in Australia, supplied in Australia, imported into Australia or exported from Australia;  (ii) the circumstances in which the death or serious injury or illness occurred;  (iii) the nature of any serious injury or illness suffered by any person;  (iv) any action that the supplier has taken, or is intending to take, in relation to the consumer goods." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The notice must:  (a) identify the consumer goods; and  (b) include information about the following matters to the extent that it is known by the supplier at the time the notice is given:  (i) when, and in what quantities, the consumer goods were manufactured in Australia, supplied in Australia, imported into Australia or exported from Australia;  (ii) the circumstances in which the death or serious injury or illness occurred;  (iii) the nature of any serious injury or illness suffered by any person;  (iv) any action that the supplier has taken, or is intending to take, in relation to the consumer goods."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "79a6b297cdc16993dfcae67b1004f2a8812105caeb4f004b343d307735adbd39" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-131-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Supplier must provide notice with specific information about consumer goods." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
