doc:sch-2-sec-134-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "134(2) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:  (a) it is clear that the death or serious injury or illness was not caused by the use or foreseeable misuse of the consumer goods to which the services relate; or  (b) it is very unlikely that the death or serious injury or illness was caused by the use or foreseeable misuse of the consumer goods to which the services relate; or  (c) the supplier, or another person, is required to notify the death or serious injury or illness in accordance with a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory that is a law specified in the regulations; or  (d) the supplier, or another person, has notified the death or serious injury or illness in accordance with an industry code of practice that:  (i) applies to the supplier or other person; and  (ii) is specified in the regulations." ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-134-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "134(3) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-134-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (1) applies whether or not consumer goods to which the product related services relate were being used before or at the time the death or serious injury or illness occurred. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (1) applies whether or not consumer goods to which the product related services relate were being used before or at the time the death or serious injury or illness occurred. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b687da31d2c5511832cb11046983b08eee0129539b2beeefd8b31f27bbacf830" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-134-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Subsection (1) applies regardless of whether consumer goods were used before or at the time of death or serious injury/illness." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
