doc:sch-2-sec-134-2-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "134(5) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The notice must:  (a) identify the product related services and the consumer goods to which the services relate; and  (b) include information about the following matters to the extent that it is known by the supplier at the time the notice is given:  (i) when the services have been supplied;  (ii) the circumstances in which the death or serious injury or illness occurred;  (iii) the nature of any serious injury or illness suffered by any person;  (iv) any action that the supplier has taken, or is intending to take, in relation to the services." ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-134-2-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "134(6) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-134-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The giving of the notice under subsection (1) is not to be taken for any purpose to be an admission by the supplier of any liability in relation to:  (a) the product related services; or  (b) the consumer goods to which the services relate; or  (c) the death or serious injury or illness of any person." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The giving of the notice under subsection (1) is not to be taken for any purpose to be an admission by the supplier of any liability in relation to:  (a) the product related services; or  (b) the consumer goods to which the services relate; or  (c) the death or serious injury or illness of any person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "84245f8864819d4c234b8a340530dd8c5f4fbcda7678fc41c37f12c1e2701487" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-134-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No liability for certain purposes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
