concept:act-sch-2-sec-138-3-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "138(3) Liability for loss or damage suffered by an injured individual"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-138-3-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the individual dies because of the injuries, a law of a State or a Territory about liability in respect of the death of individuals applies as if:  (a) the action were an action under the law of the State or Territory for damages in respect of the injuries; and  (b) the safety defect were the manufacturer’s wrongful act, neglect or default." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the individual dies because of the injuries, a law of a State or a Territory about liability in respect of the death of individuals applies as if:  (a) the action were an action under the law of the State or Territory for damages in respect of the injuries; and  (b) the safety defect were the manufacturer’s wrongful act, neglect or default."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3252631fc696310eaa2e1c264ff23b348c71abc238268d15f8e9cab3684f3078" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-138-3 ;
