    cml:logicSummary "The destruction or damage of goods occurs between the time the person uses or consumes, or intends to use or consume, the goods and the time the person suffers loss or damage." ;
    cml:premiseText "(d) The person used or consumed, or intended to use or consume, the destroyed or damaged goods for personal, domestic or household use or consumption;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "...the person suffers loss or damage as a result of the destruction or damage." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-140-3-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-140-3-ss-1-logic-ltl-3 .
