doc:sch-2-sec-150-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "150(2) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of applying subsection (1) in relation to a proceeding concerning a representation of a kind referred to in subsection (1)(e) or (f), the representation is taken to be misleading unless evidence is adduced to the contrary." ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-150-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "150(3) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-150-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the representation is not misleading; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the representation is not misleading." ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, subsection (2) does not:  (a) have the effect that, merely because such evidence to the contrary is adduced, the representation is not misleading; or  (b) have the effect of placing on any person an onus of proving that the representation is not misleading."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bcb0d71b7eba464cc1bf2f44262d22fa7976a6feba1329e3ab8f763ec6a6de6a" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-150 ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Avoids onus of proving representation is not misleading." ;
