concept:act-sch-2-sec-156-3-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156(7) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-156-3-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, accepts payment or other consideration for goods or services; and  (b) the person fails to supply all the goods or services:  (i) within the period specified by or on behalf of the person at or before the time the payment or other consideration was accepted; or  (ii) if no period is specified at or before that time—within a reasonable time. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000." ;
    skos:definition "(7) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, accepts payment or other consideration for goods or services; and  (b) the person fails to supply all the goods or services:  (i) within the period specified by or on behalf of the person at or before the time the payment or other consideration was accepted; or  (ii) if no period is specified at or before that time—within a reasonable time. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "59132620020d0408754018a6f485441035c283b5bd662dcb08c6943208fde0f1" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-156-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "162"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failing to supply goods or services within a specified period is an offence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
