    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-163-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A person is not taken for the purposes of this section to have authorised the placing of the entry or advertisement, unless:  (a) a document authorising the placing of the entry or advertisement has been signed by the person or by another person authorised by him or her; and  (b) a copy of the document has been given to the person before the right to payment of a charge for the placing of the entry or advertisement is asserted; and  (c) the document specifies:  (i) the name and address of the person publishing the entry or advertisement; and  (ii) particulars of the entry or advertisement; and  (iii) the amount of the charge for the placing of the entry or advertisement, or the basis on which the charge is, or is to be, calculated. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(6) A person is not taken for the purposes of this section to have authorised the placing of the entry or advertisement, unless:  (a) a document authorising the placing of the entry or advertisement has been signed by the person or by another person authorised by him or her; and  (b) a copy of the document has been given to the person before the right to payment of a charge for the placing of the entry or advertisement is asserted; and  (c) the document specifies:  (i) the name and address of the person publishing the entry or advertisement; and  (ii) particulars of the entry or advertisement; and  (iii) the amount of the charge for the placing of the entry or advertisement, or the basis on which the charge is, or is to be, calculated. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f27cbd21d1837a01c0bdc8774fbbd88d1295d7e1a22a87474df75fa8f963d72b" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-163-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "168"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person must provide a document authorizing the placement of an entry or advertisement before asserting the right to payment." ;
    dc:description "document authorizing the placing of the entry or advertisement" ;
