concept:act-sch-2-sec-165-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "165 Multiple pricing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-165-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, supplies goods; and  (b) the goods have more than one displayed price; and  (c) the supply takes place for a price that is not the lower, or lowest, of the displayed prices. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$5,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$1,000.  (2) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, supplies goods; and  (b) the goods have more than one displayed price; and  (c) the supply takes place for a price that is not the lower, or lowest, of the displayed prices. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$5,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$1,000.  (2) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1f6c71fb8372babea91ce559a2492b1a40e07c4ffcca2f9c167aeff8fbf0ed5a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "171"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-165-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-165-2-ss-2 ;
