    cof:title "174(1) Requirement to give document to the consumer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The dealer who negotiated an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if:  (a) the agreement was not negotiated by telephone; and  (b) the dealer does not give a copy of the agreement to the consumer under the agreement immediately after the consumer signs the agreement. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000." ;
    cof:pageNumber "179"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-174-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "174(2) Requirement to give document to the consumer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-174-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The dealer who negotiated an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if:  (a) the agreement was negotiated by telephone; and  (b) the dealer does not, within 5 business days after the agreement was made or such longer period agreed by the parties, give to the consumer under the agreement:  (i) personally; or  (ii) by post; or  (iii) with the consumer’s consent—by electronic communication;  an agreement document evidencing the agreement. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The dealer who negotiated an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if:  (a) the agreement was negotiated by telephone; and  (b) the dealer does not, within 5 business days after the agreement was made or such longer period agreed by the parties, give to the consumer under the agreement:  (i) personally; or  (ii) by post; or  (iii) with the consumer’s consent—by electronic communication;  an agreement document evidencing the agreement. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b8794d5e559aabb6a2ab1e9443f2a414a5b391d4425757d74afcdbadd2c2b01f" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-174-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "179"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Dealer must provide agreement document within 5 business days after negotiation." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
