concept:act-sch-2-sec-182-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "182 Certain provisions of unsolicited consumer agreements void"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-182-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if the agreement includes, or purports to include, a ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 provision (however described) that is, or would be, void because of section 89(1). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000.  (2) The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if the supplier attempts to enforce or rely on a provision (however described) that is void because of section 89(1). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are offences of strict liability." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if the agreement includes, or purports to include, a ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 provision (however described) that is, or would be, void because of section 89(1). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000.  (2) The supplier under an unsolicited consumer agreement commits an offence if the supplier attempts to enforce or rely on a provision (however described) that is void because of section 89(1). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$50,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$10,000.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are offences of strict liability."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a7af23ee6e98416993be5bf3d09ec030dd3f857f95a10078f28ff5a5dc07f42e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "184"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-182-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-182-2-ss-2 ;
