concept:act-sch-2-sec-187-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "187 Application of this Division to certain conduct covered by the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-187-2 ;
    values:originalText "Corporations Act  This Division does not apply in relation to conduct to which section 736, 992A or 992AA of the Corporations Act 2001 applies. Note: Section 736 of the Corporations Act 2001 prohibits hawking of securities. Section 992A of that Act prohibits hawking of certain financial products. Section 992AA of that Act prohibits hawking of managed investment products. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    skos:definition "Corporations Act  This Division does not apply in relation to conduct to which section 736, 992A or 992AA of the Corporations Act 2001 applies. Note: Section 736 of the Corporations Act 2001 prohibits hawking of securities. Section 992A of that Act prohibits hawking of certain financial products. Section 992AA of that Act prohibits hawking of managed investment products. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4221d570c508b46f61610612856391b88e80dd10e64518d4c9c3ef36bf8c7c07" ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts conduct from Division 2 of the Corporations Act 2001" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.186" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-187-2-norm .
