    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply (other than for export) consumer goods of a particular kind; and  (b) the supply would be prohibited by subsection (1). Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000." ;
    cof:pageNumber "193"^^xsd:integer .

