concept:act-sch-2-sec-202-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "202 Suppliers to report consumer goods etc. associated with the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-202-2 ;
    values:originalText "death or serious injury or illness of any person  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is required by section 131 or 132 to give a notice to the Commonwealth Minister; and  (b) the person refuses or fails to give the notice as required by that section. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$16,650; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$3,330.  (2) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "death or serious injury or illness of any person  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is required by section 131 or 132 to give a notice to the Commonwealth Minister; and  (b) the person refuses or fails to give the notice as required by that section. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$16,650; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$3,330.  (2) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
