e used for the purposes of section 136(6), that the goods are intended to be used outside Australia.  (7) Without limiting subsection (6), a statement may, for the purposes of that subsection, be applied to goods by being:  (a) woven in, impressed on, worked into or annexed or affixed to the goods; or  (b) applied to a covering, label, reel or thing in or with which the goods are supplied.  (8) Subsections (1), (2) and (3) are offences of strict liability." ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer .

