doc:sch-2-sec-203-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "203(2) Supplying etc. goods that do not comply with information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply goods of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for goods of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the goods. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000." ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-203-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "203(3) Supplying etc. goods that do not comply with information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-203-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in or for the purposes of trade or commerce, manufactures, possesses or has control of goods of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for goods of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the goods. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in or for the purposes of trade or commerce, manufactures, possesses or has control of goods of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for goods of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the goods. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "63c64636dd1156c12f74439d648512903fdae1a825bd90db5d66eb2cd5b92001" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-203-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Manufacturing, possessing or controlling goods that do not comply with information standards is prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
