doc:sch-2-sec-203-2-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "203(6) Supplying etc. goods that do not comply with information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) Unless the contrary is established, it is presumed, for the purposes of this section, that goods are intended to be used outside Australia if either of the following is applied to the goods:  (a) a statement that the goods are for export only;  (b) a statement indicating, by the use of words authorised by regulations made for the purposes of section 136(6)(b) to be used for the purposes of section 136(6), that the goods are intended to be used outside Australia." ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-203-2-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "203(7) Supplying etc. goods that do not comply with information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-203-2-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Without limiting subsection (6), a statement may, for the purposes of that subsection, be applied to goods by being:  (a) woven in, impressed on, worked into or annexed or affixed to the goods; or  (b) applied to a covering, label, reel or thing in or with which the goods are supplied." ;
    skos:definition "(7) Without limiting subsection (6), a statement may, for the purposes of that subsection, be applied to goods by being:  (a) woven in, impressed on, worked into or annexed or affixed to the goods; or  (b) applied to a covering, label, reel or thing in or with which the goods are supplied."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d8257ad6a9723d6c639c7836da511480610a17283ebe7b358c2a778867ee387f" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-203-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "198"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Goods may be supplied with a statement applied to them in certain ways." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
