doc:sch-2-sec-204-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "204 Supplying etc. services that do not comply with information" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "standards  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, supplies services of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for services of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the services. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    cof:pageNumber "199"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-194-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "194 Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-194-3 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply services of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for services of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the services. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are offences of strict liability. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply services of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for services of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the services. Penalty:  (a) if the person is a body corporate—$1,100,000; or  (b) if the person is not a body corporate—$220,000.  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are offences of strict liability. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010"@en ;
