doc:sch-2-sec-207-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "207(1) Reasonable mistake of fact" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) In a prosecution for a contravention of a provision of this Chapter, it is a defence if the defendant proves that the contravention was caused by a reasonable mistake of fact, including a mistake of fact caused by reasonable reliance on information supplied by another person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "203"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-207-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "207(2) Reasonable mistake of fact"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-207-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply in relation to information relied upon by the defendant that was supplied to the defendant by another person who was, at the time when the contravention occurred:  (a) an employee or agent of the defendant; or  (b) if the defendant is a body corporate—a director, employee or agent of the defendant." ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, subsection (1) does not apply in relation to information relied upon by the defendant that was supplied to the defendant by another person who was, at the time when the contravention occurred:  (a) an employee or agent of the defendant; or  (b) if the defendant is a body corporate—a director, employee or agent of the defendant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "38a4b1a3b365ddbc7ba03a8468afaa42e7b3d3b73d7b286dbb9ae549d3460eb6" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-207-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "203"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defendant is not liable if information relied upon was supplied by another person." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
