concept:act-sch-2-sec-202-3-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-202-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-2 .
concept:act-sch-2-sec-202-3-ss-1-logic-deontic-2 a cml:LogicApplication ;
