doc:sch-2-sec-206-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "206(5) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) The notice may relate to more than one claim or representation that the person has made." ;
    cof:pageNumber "212"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-206-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "206(6) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-206-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) This section does not apply to a person who made the claim or representation if the person:  (a) is an information provider; and  (b) made the claim or representation by publishing it on behalf of another person in the course of carrying on a business of providing information; and  (c) does not have a commercial relationship with the other person other than for the purpose of:  (i) publishing claims or representations promoting, or apparently intended to promote, the other person’s business or other activities; or  (ii) the other person supplying goods or services, or selling or granting interests in land to the person." ;
    skos:definition "(6) This section does not apply to a person who made the claim or representation if the person:  (a) is an information provider; and  (b) made the claim or representation by publishing it on behalf of another person in the course of carrying on a business of providing information; and  (c) does not have a commercial relationship with the other person other than for the purpose of:  (i) publishing claims or representations promoting, or apparently intended to promote, the other person’s business or other activities; or  (ii) the other person supplying goods or services, or selling or granting interests in land to the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dcc7b05d520ab5b943bdec73ec4ca598585d29e4e27bd3445c2c03f2ac5907ed" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-206 ;
    cof:pageNumber "212"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemption for information providers publishing on behalf of another person" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
