    cof:title "221(3) Compliance with substantiation notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Despite subsection (1), an individual may refuse or fail to give particular information or produce a particular document in compliance with a substantiation notice on the ground that the information or production of the document might tend to incriminate the individual or to expose the individual to a penalty. 222  False or misleading information etc." ;
