concept:act-sch-2-sec-221-2-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "221(1) Compliance with substantiation notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-221-2-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person must not, in compliance or purported compliance with a substantiation notice given by the regulator:  (a) give to the regulator false or misleading information; or  (b) produce to the regulator documents that contain false or misleading information. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person must not, in compliance or purported compliance with a substantiation notice given by the regulator:  (a) give to the regulator false or misleading information; or  (b) produce to the regulator documents that contain false or misleading information. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection."@en ;
