doc:sch-2-sec-221-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "221(1) Compliance with substantiation notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person must not, in compliance or purported compliance with a substantiation notice given by the regulator:  (a) give to the regulator false or misleading information; or  (b) produce to the regulator documents that contain false or misleading information. Note: A pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this subsection." ;
