doc:sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "240(1) Determining whether to make a redress order etc. for non-party" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(a), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct, since the contravention occurred. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  The Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 1  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "240(2) Determining whether to make a redress order etc. for non-party"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(b), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the declared term, since the declaration was made." ;
    skos:definition "(2) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(b), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the declared term, since the declaration was made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1e7301e04845e2f001bebed9ae8c39ad98863863ef3531f84e253dd9f7ceb106" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No effect on non-party consumer Consider conduct of person and non-party consumers in relation to declared term when determining whether to make an order under section 239(1)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.228" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-2-norm .
