doc:sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "240(2) Determining whether to make a redress order etc. for non-party" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(b), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the declared term, since the declaration was made." ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "240(3) Determining whether to make a redress order etc. for non-party"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1), the court need not make a finding about either of the following matters:  (a) which persons are non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct or declared term;  (b) the nature of the loss or damage suffered, or likely to be suffered, by such persons. 241  When a non-party consumer is bound by a redress order etc." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1), the court need not make a finding about either of the following matters:  (a) which persons are non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct or declared term;  (b) the nature of the loss or damage suffered, or likely to be suffered, by such persons. 241  When a non-party consumer is bound by a redress order etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "89f2a24848ef570f750db3fd76fd344964f413fcb1e03d4a4a91cf3d76f28174" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No claim, action or demand may be made against the person by the non-party consumer. Court does not need to find non-party consumers or nature of loss/damage in determining whether to make a redress order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.228" ;
