concept:act-sch-2-sec-234-3-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "234(4) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-234-3-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), the regulations:  (a) may prescribe changes (whether in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) that are not fundamental changes for the purposes of that subsection; and  (b) may include examples (in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) of changes which are fundamental changes for the purposes of that subsection." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), the regulations:  (a) may prescribe changes (whether in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) that are not fundamental changes for the purposes of that subsection; and  (b) may include examples (in relation to particular classes of goods or otherwise) of changes which are fundamental changes for the purposes of that subsection."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9b8d82f8ae910ee0c8ca68328af9cd173cdf9cbf2d129e4bed056cd50971f66c" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-234-3 ;
