 cost; or  (c) a particular overhead cost, or a part of an overhead cost; is not allowable in respect of goods, or classes of goods.  (3) The regulations may, for the purposes of subsection (1), prescribe the manner of working out:  (a) the cost of a material, or part of the cost; or  (b) a labour cost, or part of the cost; or  (c) an overhead cost, or part of the cost. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
