doc:sch-2-sec-265-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "265(2) Termination of contracts for the supply of services that are" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The termination takes effect:  (a) at the time the termination is made known to the supplier of the services (whether by words or by conduct indicating the consumer’s intention to terminate the contract); or  (b) if it is not reasonably practicable to communicate with the supplier of the services—at the time the consumer indicates, by means which are reasonable in the circumstances, his or her intention to terminate the contract." ;
    cof:pageNumber "249"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-265-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "265(3) Termination of contracts for the supply of services that are"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-265-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The consumer is entitled to recover, by action against the supplier of the services, a refund of:  (a) any money paid by the consumer for the services; and  (b) an amount that is equal to the value of any other consideration provided by the consumer for the services; to the extent that the consumer has not already consumed the services at the time the termination takes effect. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The consumer is entitled to recover, by action against the supplier of the services, a refund of:  (a) any money paid by the consumer for the services; and  (b) an amount that is equal to the value of any other consideration provided by the consumer for the services; to the extent that the consumer has not already consumed the services at the time the termination takes effect. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7728624f77b3d3156d0967e58db3d0fe2076c6e064fb6d72dfa793a9fcf8d018" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-265-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "249"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consumer entitled to refund for services" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
