    cml:logicSummary "Manufacturer has an obligation to indemnify supplier." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) A manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier is liable to pay damages under section 259(4) to the consumer for loss or damage suffered by the consumer; and  (b) the manufacturer is or would be liable under section 271 to pay damages to the consumer for the same loss or damage." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) A manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier is liable to pay damages under section 259(4) to the consumer for loss or damage suffered by the consumer; and  (b) the manufacturer is or would be liable under section 271 to pay damages to the consumer for the same loss or damage." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-2-sec-274-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "274(1) Indemnification of suppliers by manufacturers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier is liable to pay damages under section 259(4) to the consumer for loss or damage suffered by the consumer; and  (b) the manufacturer is or would be liable under section 271 to pay damages to the consumer for the same loss or damage." ;
    cof:pageNumber "257"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-274-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "274(2) Indemnification of suppliers by manufacturers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-274-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier incurs costs because the supplier is liable under this Part for a failure to comply with a guarantee that applies to the supply under Subdivision A of Division 1 of Part 3-2; and  (b) the failure is:  (i) a failure to comply with the guarantee under section 54; or  (ii) a failure to comply with the guarantee under section 55 in relation to a disclosed purpose that the consumer made known to the manufacturer either directly or through the supplier or the person referred to in section 55(2)(a)(ii); or  (iii) a failure to comply with the guarantee under section 56 in relation to a description that was applied to the goods by or on behalf of the manufacturer of the goods, or with the express or implied consent of the manufacturer." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a manufacturer of goods is liable to indemnify a person (the supplier) who supplies the goods to a consumer if:  (a) the supplier incurs costs because the supplier is liable under this Part for a failure to comply with a guarantee that applies to the supply under Subdivision A of Division 1 of Part 3-2; and  (b) the failure is:  (i) a failure to comply with the guarantee under section 54; or  (ii) a failure to comply with the guarantee under section 55 in relation to a disclosed purpose that the consumer made known to the manufacturer either directly or through the supplier or the person referred to in section 55(2)(a)(ii); or  (iii) a failure to comply with the guarantee under section 56 in relation to a description that was applied to the goods by or on behalf of the manufacturer of the goods, or with the express or implied consent of the manufacturer."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0446039dcd092962dcdedd040cb52cdd43b63516ff1682f627767eebf6d9ab06" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-274-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "257"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Manufacturer must indemnify supplier for costs incurred due to failure to comply with guarantee." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
