concept:act-sch-2-sec-131c-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "131C(4) Saving of other laws and remedies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-131c-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Except as expressly provided by this Part or the Australian Consumer Law, nothing in this Part or the Australian Consumer Law is taken to limit, restrict or otherwise affect any right or remedy a person would have had if this Part and the Australian Consumer Law had not been enacted. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law" ;
