    cml:operator "before" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Certification must occur before interim ban is imposed." ;
    cml:premiseText "(c) before the ban was imposed, the Commonwealth Minister..." ;
    cml:conclusionText "...without delay." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-2-sec-132e-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "132E(1) Opportunity for a conference after an interim ban has been" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an interim ban on consumer goods of a particular kind, or on product related services of a particular kind, is in force; and  (b) the interim ban was imposed by the Commonwealth Minister; and  (c) before the ban was imposed, the Commonwealth Minister published a notice under section 132J certifying that the interim ban should be imposed without delay." ;
    cof:pageNumber "281"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-132e-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132E(2) Opportunity for a conference after an interim ban has been"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-132e-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commonwealth Minister must, by written notice published on the internet, invite any person who supplied, or proposes to supply:  (a) consumer goods of that kind; or  (b) product related services of that kind; to notify the Commission, in writing and within a period specified in the notice, if the person wishes the Commission to hold a conference in relation to the interim ban." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Commonwealth Minister must, by written notice published on the internet, invite any person who supplied, or proposes to supply:  (a) consumer goods of that kind; or  (b) product related services of that kind; to notify the Commission, in writing and within a period specified in the notice, if the person wishes the Commission to hold a conference in relation to the interim ban."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d871f36b534c0ccac5ef1572b51bda4c4ff0765514558bb9bac68483d40fa8e9" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-132e ;
    cof:pageNumber "281"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Commonwealth Minister must invite persons to notify the Commission within a specified period." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.281" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-132e-ss-2-norm .
