concept:act-sch-2-sec-133a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133A(5) Identity cards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-133a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsection (3) does not apply if the identity card was lost or destroyed. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsection (3) does not apply if the identity card was lost or destroyed. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
