concept:act-sch-2-sec-133b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133B Power to enter premises to which the public has access—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-133b ;
    values:originalText "consumer goods  (1) An inspector may enter premises in or from which a person, in trade or commerce, supplies consumer goods, if the public has access to the premises at the time of entry, for the purpose of ascertaining whether:  (a) any of those consumer goods will or may cause injury to any person; or  (b) a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of those consumer goods will or may cause injury to any person; and remain on the premises for such a purpose while the public has access to the premises.  (2) While on the premises, the inspector may:  (a) take photographs of:  (i) any of those consumer goods; or  (ii) equipment used in the manufacturing, processing or storage any of those consumer goods; and  (b) inspect, handle and measure any of those consumer goods; and  (c) purchase any of those consumer goods." ;
    skos:definition "consumer goods  (1) An inspector may enter premises in or from which a person, in trade or commerce, supplies consumer goods, if the public has access to the premises at the time of entry, for the purpose of ascertaining whether:  (a) any of those consumer goods will or may cause injury to any person; or  (b) a reasonably foreseeable use (including a misuse) of those consumer goods will or may cause injury to any person; and remain on the premises for such a purpose while the public has access to the premises.  (2) While on the premises, the inspector may:  (a) take photographs of:  (i) any of those consumer goods; or  (ii) equipment used in the manufacturing, processing or storage any of those consumer goods; and  (b) inspect, handle and measure any of those consumer goods; and  (c) purchase any of those consumer goods."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "29c8ba8f32d6884d45af1946a59374bd6596bce3dbbe6dda442638435a0c67b8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "286"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-133b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-133b-ss-2 ;
