concept:act-sch-2-sec-133e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133E Self-incrimination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-133e ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person is not excused from:  (a) giving information or evidence; or  (b) producing a document; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Application of the Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 as required by a disclosure notice given to the person on the ground that the information or evidence, or production of the document, might tend to incriminate the person or expose the person to a penalty.  (2) However, in the case of an individual:  (a) the information or evidence given, or the document produced; and  (b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the document; are not admissible in evidence against the individual:  (c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or  (d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against the individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person is not excused from:  (a) giving information or evidence; or  (b) producing a document; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Application of the Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 as required by a disclosure notice given to the person on the ground that the information or evidence, or production of the document, might tend to incriminate the person or expose the person to a penalty.  (2) However, in the case of an individual:  (a) the information or evidence given, or the document produced; and  (b) giving the information or evidence, or producing the document; are not admissible in evidence against the individual:  (c) in any proceedings instituted by the individual; or  (d) in any criminal proceedings, other than proceedings against the individual for an offence against section 133F or 133G."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f720cd598960a2e626bb41fd80448e980ac7f65eff3fe1c92a5322ea33ba4d9b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "288"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-2-sec-133e-ss-1 ;
