doc:sch-2-sec-133f-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "133F(2) Compliance with disclosure notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person complies with the disclosure notice to the extent to which the person is capable of complying with the notice. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code." ;
    cof:pageNumber "289"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-133f-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "133F(3) Compliance with disclosure notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-133f-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability. Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code. 133G  False or misleading information etc.  A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person gives information, evidence or a document in purported compliance with a disclosure notice; and  (b) the person does so knowing that the information, evidence or document is false or misleading in a material particular. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (1) is an offence of strict liability. Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code. 133G  False or misleading information etc.  A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person gives information, evidence or a document in purported compliance with a disclosure notice; and  (b) the person does so knowing that the information, evidence or document is false or misleading in a material particular. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1dd7b1ecfc67d6fab84cbcf6d2f454cedde8840bc1146675ae716df21749a33f" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-133f ;
    cof:pageNumber "289"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Compliance with disclosure notices is an offence of strict liability." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
