concept:act-sch-2-sec-134f-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "134F(6) Infringement notice compliance period for infringement notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-134f-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Division to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Application of the Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Division to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Application of the Australian Consumer Law  Schedule 2  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5186fccee743e8d906ca42db08c9557356979a3682f2607a5bf079810b6d9ec6" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-134f ;
    cof:pageNumber "298"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reference to extended infringement notice compliance period" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
