    values:originalText "(2) If an inspector enters premises under a search warrant, the inspector may require any person on the premises to:  (a) answer any questions relating to the reasons for the inspector entering the premises that are put by the inspector; and  (b) produce any document relating to the reasons for the inspector entering the premises that is requested by the inspector." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If an inspector enters premises under a search warrant, the inspector may require any person on the premises to:  (a) answer any questions relating to the reasons for the inspector entering the premises that are put by the inspector; and  (b) produce any document relating to the reasons for the inspector entering the premises that is requested by the inspector."@en ;
