doc:sch-2-sec-135f-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "135F(3) Announcement before entry under warrant" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a)  the inspector does not comply with subsection (1) because of subsection (2); and  (b) the occupier of the premises, or another person who apparently represents the occupier, is present at the premises; the inspector must, as soon as practicable after entering the premises, show his or her identity card to the occupier or other person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "305"^^xsd:integer .

