concept:act-sch-2-sec-135y-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135Y(3) Compliance with embargo notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-135y-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (1) or (2) does not apply in relation to:  (a) an act done in accordance with a consent given under section 135X; or  (b) if the embargo notice relates to consumer goods—an act done for the purpose of protecting or preserving the consumer goods; or  (c) if the embargo notice relates to product related services—an act done for the purpose of protecting or preserving equipment used to supply the services. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (1) or (2) does not apply in relation to:  (a) an act done in accordance with a consent given under section 135X; or  (b) if the embargo notice relates to consumer goods—an act done for the purpose of protecting or preserving the consumer goods; or  (c) if the embargo notice relates to product related services—an act done for the purpose of protecting or preserving equipment used to supply the services. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eed3ea0efa5c11990bcbff04c8b009c34ac725cfe4e5c1af9fb55d0e685f2402" ;
