concept:act-sch-2-sec-139-3-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "139(2) Intervention by the Commission"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-139-3-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the Commission intervenes in a proceeding, the Commission is taken to be a party to the proceeding and has all the rights, duties and liabilities of such a party." ;
