    skos:prefLabel "139C(2) Conduct of employees or agents of persons other than bodies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-139c-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Any conduct engaged in on behalf of a person (the principal) other than a body corporate:  (a) by an employee or agent of the principal within the scope of the actual or apparent authority of the employee or agent; or  (b) by any other person:  (i) at the direction of an employee or agent of the principal; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Any conduct engaged in on behalf of a person (the principal) other than a body corporate:  (a) by an employee or agent of the principal within the scope of the actual or apparent authority of the employee or agent; or  (b) by any other person:  (i) at the direction of an employee or agent of the principal; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 2  Application of the Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "06e0dbd006143f738a7fd257958be662ea44e7f48a70dd1ef66105ffc087e3ff" ;
