    values:originalText "(4) Subsection (1) does not by implication limit the meaning of a reference in this Division to:  (a) a misleading representation; or  (b) a representation that is misleading in a material particular; or  (c) conduct that is misleading or is likely or liable to mislead; and, in particular, does not imply that a representation that a person makes with respect to any future matter is not misleading merely because the person has reasonable grounds for making the representation." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Subsection (1) does not by implication limit the meaning of a reference in this Division to:  (a) a misleading representation; or  (b) a representation that is misleading in a material particular; or  (c) conduct that is misleading or is likely or liable to mislead; and, in particular, does not imply that a representation that a person makes with respect to any future matter is not misleading merely because the person has reasonable grounds for making the representation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a639f6e8edaaa5e1137a7529c2daddff0ebf6544da8e5b70d2c4b27ded25299b" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-3-sec-12bb ;
    cof:pageNumber "346"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Does not limit the meaning of a reference to misleading representations, conduct, or material particulars." ;
