concept:act-sch-3-sec-22-ss-2c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22(2C) After subsection 12DE(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-22-ss-2c ;
    values:originalText "(2C) Subsection (2A) does not apply to an offer that the person makes to another person if:  (a) the person offers to the other person a different rebate, gift, prize or other free item as a replacement; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Amendment of the Corporations legislation  Schedule 3  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (b) the other person agrees to receive the different rebate, gift, prize or other free item." ;
    skos:definition "(2C) Subsection (2A) does not apply to an offer that the person makes to another person if:  (a) the person offers to the other person a different rebate, gift, prize or other free item as a replacement; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Amendment of the Corporations legislation  Schedule 3  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  (b) the other person agrees to receive the different rebate, gift, prize or other free item."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4fc6c939ce5fa00fc9071de54ad390da49937d6f3675a9beb221539b9ecc8ad8" ;
