concept:act-sch-5-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 Subsection 4(1) (definition of personal injury)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: personal injury includes:  (a) pre-natal injury; or  (b) impairment of a person’s physical or mental condition; or  (c) disease; but does not include an impairment of a person’s mental condition unless the impairment consists of a recognised psychiatric illness." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: personal injury includes:  (a) pre-natal injury; or  (b) impairment of a person’s physical or mental condition; or  (c) disease; but does not include an impairment of a person’s mental condition unless the impairment consists of a recognised psychiatric illness."@en ;
