concept:act-sch-5-sec-47 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47 Subsection 26(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-47 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) The Commission may, by resolution, delegate:  (a) any of its functions and powers under or in relation to Parts VI and XI and the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) any of its powers under Part XII that relate to those Parts or the Australian Consumer Law; to a staff member of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission within the meaning of section 5 of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Other amendments of the Trade Practices Act 1974  Schedule 5  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 Note: The heading to section 26 is altered by omitting “in relation to unconscionable conduct and consumer protection” and substituting “of certain functions and powers”." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) The Commission may, by resolution, delegate:  (a) any of its functions and powers under or in relation to Parts VI and XI and the Australian Consumer Law; and  (b) any of its powers under Part XII that relate to those Parts or the Australian Consumer Law; to a staff member of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission within the meaning of section 5 of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Other amendments of the Trade Practices Act 1974  Schedule 5  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 Note: The heading to section 26 is altered by omitting “in relation to unconscionable conduct and consumer protection” and substituting “of certain functions and powers”."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f0b986b099de33cd53cce84267a04db8b75102cdee2c84cbd27ec17934ad5caf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "372"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of functions and powers to staff members" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.372" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-5-sec-47-norm .
concept:act-sch-5-sec-47-norm a values:Undertaking ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-5-sec-47 ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
concept:act-sch-5-sec-47 cml:asserts concept:act-sch-5-sec-47-logic-deontic-1 .
