concept:act-sch-6-sec-33zh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33ZH Special provision relating to claims under Part VI of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-33zh ;
    values:originalText "Competition and Consumer Act 2010 etc.  (1) For the purposes of the following provisions, a group member in a representative proceeding is to be taken to be a party to the proceeding:  (a) subsection 87(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010;  (b) subsection 238(1) of Schedule 2 to that Act, as that subsection applies as a law of the Commonwealth.  (2) An application by a representative party in a representative proceeding under:  (a) subsection 87(1A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (b) subsection 237(1) of Schedule 2 to that Act, as that subsection applies as a law of the Commonwealth; is to be taken to be an application by the representative party and all the group members. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 6  Amendment of other Acts to change references to the Trade Practices Act" ;
    skos:definition "Competition and Consumer Act 2010 etc.  (1) For the purposes of the following provisions, a group member in a representative proceeding is to be taken to be a party to the proceeding:  (a) subsection 87(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010;  (b) subsection 238(1) of Schedule 2 to that Act, as that subsection applies as a law of the Commonwealth.  (2) An application by a representative party in a representative proceeding under:  (a) subsection 87(1A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (b) subsection 237(1) of Schedule 2 to that Act, as that subsection applies as a law of the Commonwealth; is to be taken to be an application by the representative party and all the group members. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  Schedule 6  Amendment of other Acts to change references to the Trade Practices Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "081176a7083010c1264f771155a5201299ed88a8a45d4a0f796e0d7f4e1ab358" ;
    cof:pageNumber "397"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-6-sec-33zh-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-6-sec-33zh-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.397" .
