concept:act-sch-6-sec-165 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "165 Paragraph 10(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-165 ;
    values:originalText "Omit “Part IVA or Division 1 or 1A of Part V of the Trade Practices Act 1974”, substitute “Part 2-2, 3-1, 3-3 or 3-4 of Schedule 2 to the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, as that Part applies as a law of the Commonwealth”. Note: The heading to section 10 is altered by omitting “Division 1 or 1A of Part V of the Trade Practices Act” and substituting “the Australian Consumer Law”. Motor Vehicle Standards Act 1989" ;
