    skos:prefLabel "11 Regulations relating to professional standards laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "Regulations made for the purposes of section 87AB of the Trade Practices Act 1974 that were in force immediately before the commencement of this item have effect, after the commencement of this item, as if they had been made for the purposes of section 137 of that Act as amended by this Act." ;
    skos:definition "Regulations made for the purposes of section 87AB of the Trade Practices Act 1974 that were in force immediately before the commencement of this item have effect, after the commencement of this item, as if they had been made for the purposes of section 137 of that Act as amended by this Act."@en ;
