    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "matters The Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters of a transitional, application or saving nature in relation to the amendments and repeals made by the Schedules to this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868   Notes to the  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  Table of Acts  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 Notes to the Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 Note 1 The Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 as shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 103, 2010 amended as indicated in the Tables below. Table of Acts Act Number and year Date of Assent Date of commencement Application, saving or transitional provisions Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 103, 2010" ;
    skos:definition "matters The Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters of a transitional, application or saving nature in relation to the amendments and repeals made by the Schedules to this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868  ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00868   Notes to the  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010  Table of Acts  Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 Notes to the Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 Note 1 The Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 as shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 103, 2010 amended as indicated in the Tables below. Table of Acts Act Number and year Date of Assent Date of commencement Application, saving or transitional provisions Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010 103, 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4aea17c661b6f02aa11c639bbaad44935c052c307bc1e8ad2bd6ade0af7345f8" ;
